<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>로그인 실패 - WANG BOARD</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <a href="/" class="logo">WANG BOARD</a>
            <nav>
                <a href="/login">로그인</a>
                <a href="/signup">회원가입</a>
            </nav>
        </header>

        <div class="auth-form" style="text-align: center;">
            <div style="font-size: 4rem; margin-bottom: 20px;">❌</div>
            <h1 style="color: var(--neon-pink); margin-bottom: 20px;">로그인 실패</h1>
            <p style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 1.1rem;">
                아이디 또는 비밀번호가 일치하지 않습니다.
            </p>
            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px;">
                <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 12px;">다시 로그인하기</a>
                <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-outline" style="padding: 12px;">회원가입 하러가기</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
